{"title":"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_(Alcumus)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution (Alcumus)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Note\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Note</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Function\" title=\"Function\">Functions</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quadratic\">quadratic</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/e/04e4e2484e8042f221f7641b41787ccf901fbc04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x) = - f(100 - x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"18\" />, and the graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> contains the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vertex\" title=\"Vertex\">vertex</a> of the graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" />. The four <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercepts on the two graphs have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-coordinates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/a/ccada11db7b2b90693e2fac4f887a57fce6f96bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7d010bbff66a0c41e43310a51efbaa6bf63396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee60922c5fc5ee1941df04f838cdae71fbc29d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/0/420543d9a4f93ed4180b45b3149b663a8aa7674d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" />, in increasing order, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3b0076bde2ef2f3933032be81f84f179ca4053.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_3 - x_2 = 150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/6/bc62d7ceada737111dc5d7985334083b25c035c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_4 - x_1 = m + n\\sqrt p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are positive integers, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is not divisible by the square of any prime. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/2/8f23423034093484df72a3171da00744b1e11963.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m + n + p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/8/7e8acf5a3741143dc77a1e4c867dd13bb1067776.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 602\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 652\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 702\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 752 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 802$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"439\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.28Alcumus.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_(Alcumus)\">Solution (Alcumus)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution (Alcumus)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/8/ea8ac43e7941f88d8b25a44e8f402a22b1617cac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import graph; size(250);Label k; k.p=fontsize(6); int ymax = 400, ymin = -400; real rt = 175+150*2^.5; real f(real x){return 1/400*(x-125)*(x+rt);} real g(real x){return -f(100-x);} xaxis(-600,600,Ticks(k, 5),Arrows(6));yaxis(ymin,ymax,Ticks(k, 5),Arrows(6));  draw(graph(f,-450,300),red+linewidth(0.8),Arrows(6));draw(graph(g,-200,550),blue+linewidth(0.8),Arrows(6)); draw((50,ymax)--(50,ymin),linetype(&quot;4 4&quot;),Arrows(4));dot((-rt,0));dot((100+rt,0));dot((-25,0));dot((125,0)); [/asy]\" width=\"418\" height=\"275\" /></center>\n<p>The two quadratics are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" /> rotations of each other about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/e/24e7cc57eac46b6cf0b6eb4bc07b393ff5e4ee22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(50,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />. Since we are only dealing with differences of roots, we can translate them to be symmetric about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />. Now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b024a706cdf9e0ea65c3c403d852a1f73fe15e82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_3 = - x_2 = 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/9/cd9f45d3383fc2ee4f9777835d12068852e90eb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_4 = - x_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"10\" />. Say our translated versions of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, respectively, so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/5/ac5ae62c8260538431f7ec0b237eb571bfe4c7fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x) = - q( - x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adf58bc6622905a518adb538fda7ee46d13d0fef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_3 = 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" /> be a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e1a76f08084f1e1ac0906d5b2f53313f0efa4bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2 = - 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" /> a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> by symmetry. Note that since they each contain each other's vertex, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/a/ccada11db7b2b90693e2fac4f887a57fce6f96bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7d010bbff66a0c41e43310a51efbaa6bf63396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee60922c5fc5ee1941df04f838cdae71fbc29d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/0/420543d9a4f93ed4180b45b3149b663a8aa7674d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> must be roots of alternating polynomials, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/a/ccada11db7b2b90693e2fac4f887a57fce6f96bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> is a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/0/420543d9a4f93ed4180b45b3149b663a8aa7674d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/3/7c3ca73017503cd793f3965def892b14a2331811.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[p(x) = a(x - 75)(x - x_1)\\]\" width=\"196\" height=\"18\" /></center>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/6/e66be70cc10a674a7ab821d066ba50eca4afe25f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[q(x) = - a(x + 75)(x + x_1)\\]\" width=\"209\" height=\"18\" /></center>\n<p>The vertex of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> is half the sum of its roots, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3d3452233b645c1162f419b39763c9634bba3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {75 + x_1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" />. We are told that the vertex of one quadratic lies on the other, so\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/c/1bca712494ac3ccd8bd454be08ab880255e2d26b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{eqnarray*} p\\left(\\frac {75 + x_1}{2}\\right) &amp; = &amp; a\\left(\\frac {75 - x_1}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac { - 75 + x_1}{2}\\right) \\\\ &amp; = &amp; - \\frac {a}{4}(x_1 - 75)^2 \\\\ - \\frac {a}{4}(x_1 - 75)^2 &amp; = &amp; q\\left(\\frac {75 + x_1}{2}\\right) \\\\ &amp; = &amp; - a\\left(\\frac {x_1 + 225}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac {3x_1 + 75}{2}\\right) \\\\ &amp; = &amp; - \\frac {a}{4}(x_1 + 225)(3x_1 + 75) \\end{eqnarray*}\" width=\"374\" height=\"220\" /></center>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/9/7d9177e051a7e0278f11a5fa54738ef8f016026f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 = 75u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" /> and divide through by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/6/7e689d1278c41b1d53a67ea277b93078316bf09a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75^2$\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" />, since it will drastically simplify computations. We know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/f/72f14a1a226ff27116518251cc1778b190f6d4be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u &lt; - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/f/33fe0f469dfe27187ab7fe37a3c39204bee71171.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(u - 1)^2 = (3u + 1)(u + 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"206\" height=\"19\" />, or\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/9/369c373ca02974656cb1caba542ca177c3397fdc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{eqnarray*} 0 &amp; = &amp; (3u + 1)(u + 3) - (u - 1)^2 \\\\ &amp; = &amp; 3u^2 + 10u + 3 - (u^2 - 2u + 1) \\\\ &amp; = &amp; 2u^2 + 12u + 2 \\\\ &amp; = &amp; u^2 + 6u + 1 \\end{eqnarray*}\" width=\"290\" height=\"91\" /></center>\n<p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/c/4bc1f226c36733bef67e9f85a3fc8eea30bdbb96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u = \\frac { - 6\\pm\\sqrt {32}}{2} = - 3\\pm2\\sqrt2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"221\" height=\"41\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/f/72f14a1a226ff27116518251cc1778b190f6d4be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u &lt; - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/3/1d34092843ba45cccedfd28c9a215387bf37f9ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u = - 3 - 2\\sqrt2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/8/7c8ed069aa5b614ed2621b4e3b4ba46b7a065142.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_4 - x_1 = (-x_1) - x_1 = - 150u = 450 + 300\\sqrt {2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"370\" height=\"21\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/1/c21121f54b5973ab53db89d2a2598b90c6cbdca0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$450 + 300 + 2 = 752\\ \\mathbf{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"193\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Note\">Note</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Note\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Actually it is not necessary to solve any quadratic equations, if one utilizes the two facts about the quadratic <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71d13ac0e00358ad3fa8b0d6db3217b8a10cc7d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" /> (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c28242522f23e896074dc89612847f8317911d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />) that (i) the difference of the two quadratic roots equals to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/2/83204d217ebefd686d219c24f6431c8550d66c2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\Delta}/a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"22\" />, and (ii) that the minimum value of a quadratic equals to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/4/c046f28f978dc4a969e148f3ecb125f65714a5b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\Delta/4a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/e/c5e45f290267432d6b5202adb894a75bf362b1e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta=b^2-4ac$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />. Here is a possible adjustment to the solution:\n</p><p>Without loss of generality we may \"shift\" <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/9/df93ae0e9ebaf28a0afa5a27f3475c7f84baea9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1,x_2,x_3,x_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"11\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> units to the left, then the differences of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/b/67bc6daa9d6b964201d6cef60cbeb1ac5fd26ead.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> remain the same, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee60922c5fc5ee1941df04f838cdae71fbc29d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7d010bbff66a0c41e43310a51efbaa6bf63396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> are symmetrical about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b942ef0caca91281337b6b47f4ddf30191a04b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2=-75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/a/fcaba46227370adf1400d28919f2df70499c0d7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_3=75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />. The relationship of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9f36fa37c08605cc75a954079f0abfcd696f22f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)=-f(-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />. So we may write:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/3/aa31c2cd9705860eeedf5556825cbd4842ba6c07.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x)=a(x-b)^2 + m\\]\" width=\"168\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/2/1c27413d3d521825e3e36cff0d5e403c59bd38c7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[g(x)=-a(x+b)^2 - m\\]\" width=\"181\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Again without loss of generality, we can assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c28242522f23e896074dc89612847f8317911d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/a/91a5b8b0bb9d8e27be1b824f08fd6df60ba1d9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> (Short argument is needed here instead of the lazy \"wlog\"). Also, the vertex of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/c/cec7fb8124dcebb66a59d7150ccb0ef4ff9fa8a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b,m)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/c/6fcc28b3ab193566ee553c7536da8837b37abc5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=g(b)=-4ab^2-m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"19\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/2/922dc8c147691fb2d70ac0405d2f05bf9ae68c9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=-2ab^2 &lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bc19d54b91045a003e06d8d8a0ee72a7faa275b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2,x_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" /> are roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" />, we have the following relationship of the roots:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/6/f1613a57e12afa83ace9ac3e95b4c180e244de61.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_2 + x_4 = 2b\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/a/0eaea17d72806181717d045e948df0edb0803740.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_4 - x_2 = \\sqrt{\\Delta}/a = \\sqrt{-4am}/a = 2\\sqrt{-m/a} = 2\\sqrt{2b^2} = 2\\sqrt{2}b = \\sqrt{2} (x_2+x_4)\\]\" width=\"578\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/8/a18a246cd3608a549c684db4ec809cb431875876.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{2}-1)x_4 = 75(1+\\sqrt{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"201\" height=\"24\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/e/1de2748f43ebbb09ae564f1bee03de40b733754b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_4 = 75(1+\\sqrt{2})^2 = 75(3+2\\sqrt{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"257\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/9/d49ac4502bb20a838d7fa6696e7695ecfce1800a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_4-x_1=2x_4=450+300\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"234\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2009AMC12A_23.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/5/53/2009AMC12A_23.png/500px-2009AMC12A_23.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"408\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/5/53/2009AMC12A_23.png/750px-2009AMC12A_23.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/5/53/2009AMC12A_23.png/1000px-2009AMC12A_23.png 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/5/ae5f146429ad17e3f57f0c314f288b873324a731.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x) = g(50-(50-x)), f(x) = f(50+(50-x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"387\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d3b814b941fac726e7472d4a819780836be4f57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=&gt;$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"10\" /> the two functions are symmetric over <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/0/1f01823e8695b03be2e57d98a777a521d5069ebc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=50$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/8/0c80490293b4dd48442177db51cee93abf5539eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_3-x_2 = 150 =&gt; x_2 = -25, x_3 = 125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"301\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/5/b455051aa67e3457f2e3046f847c1b9f68baa4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x) = a(x-x_1)(x-x_3) = a[2(150+m)+m]m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"386\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/5/6753118674ff29bd854d11e26ebac867d6b18237.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = -a(x-x_2)(x_x-x_4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"223\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/7/74708292733e5fbd8201741f14dbecacbdbaaa28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=-a(150+m)(-(150+m))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"232\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/d/a4d6ea9e33fb9a1ed862754fdcf78fc83c800d8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=a(150+m)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/7/797e8825ee0a5cfb52a415ee4baa938e0720f671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2+2m(150+m) = (150+m)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"263\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/b/c5b947eec7b27386ae0183cbe3432472b812ead6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3m^2+300m = m^2+300m+150^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"270\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/0/fe09a8907920d8def6619930aad36945836370b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 75\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf3eba70f3eaa20f6543fe7a39b213887a9d3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_4-x_1 = 3(150+m) + m = 450+300\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"336\" height=\"24\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/e/fcea2ba31c8590f89f875aa1eda376746ae9de76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$450+300+2 = \\boxed{752}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"173\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>-cassphe\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A\">2009 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Proble